      <p>Technicians may take photographs or short videos of the appliance, its model/serial details, visible damage, faulty components, the repair process, and replaced parts. These are used only for legitimate purposes such as diagnosis, service documentation, warranty verification, quality control, and resolving disputes about the condition of the appliance or the work carried out.</p>
