      <h2>7. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We take reasonable technical and organisational measures appropriate to a business of our size and nature to protect the personal information we hold from unauthorised access, loss, misuse or alteration. No method of storage or transmission over the internet is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security. If we become aware of a personal data breach that affects you, we will take reasonable steps to notify you and address the issue in accordance with applicable law.</p>

      <h2>8. Data Retention</h2>
