      <h2>10. Your Rights and How to Reach Us</h2>
      <p>India's data protection framework — the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, together with the Digital Personal Data Protection Rules, 2025 — is being brought into force in phases. Some provisions (including foundational definitions and the establishment of the Data Protection Board of India) are already in effect, while the core obligations relating to consent, notice and the specific rights of individuals over their personal data (such as access, correction and erasure requests) are scheduled to come into force at a later date under the Government's notified timeline. We will update this Policy as these provisions come into effect and as our compliance obligations become clearer.</p>
      <p>In the meantime, and independent of when each legal provision formally commences, Home Sure will, on a good-faith basis and to the extent reasonably practicable for our business:</p>
